description: |
    Results imported from a custom ``results.yaml`` or ``results.json``
    file, or reported by ``tmt-report-result`` in the restraint
    compatibility mode, now carry the ``fmf-id``, ``web-link`` and
    ``data-path`` keys of the test that produced them, and their ``ids``
    include the IDs of the test. Previously these keys were left empty,
    and reports such as :ref:`/plugins/report/junit` were missing a link
    to the test source.
